      "created_at": "2026-07-21T17:57:28.616Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-91\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-91\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a207b25d5dc8a6620aab8ce801ba438ae9da3f25.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"837B72\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-91\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Editor's Note #91</a></h3>\n\n  <p>The last live show before the next live show, which is next week! Show Notes: Run Time: 2:05:58 This Editor's Note was recorded live last Thursday, July 16th, 2026, and the audience was great! Always a delight to hear from everyone and get to answer...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Upcoming Schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuesday, August 4th: No Episode! Gen Con Consumes All!</li>\n<li>Tuesday, August 11th: Gen Con Live 2026 recording released!</li>\n<li>Tuesday, August 18st: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#92</span> (the promised Tango-sode)</li>\n<li>Tuesday, August 25th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#326</span> - Writers’ Room: Stealth Suit Bunker</li>\n</ul>",
