    {
      "id": 265887,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2026-07-21T21:58:20.069Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Wait, what’s a Tango? o_o; Am I stupid or just old?</p>\n<p>No, yeah, that last Bloodsworn Entertainment question is fantastic. XD</p>\n<p>Looking more into it, I think it’s safe to say Grant Morrison’s pronouns are they/he, and they’re not terribly concerned either way.</p>\n<p>No, Orbo is not scrunkly. XD He’s two letters off blorbo though, so that might fit.</p>\n<p>“We’re not liars, which as you know is a lie” is the best answer to anything I’ve ever heard lmao</p>\n<p>Learning Setback’s secret identity is very Lex Luthor in Flash’s body.</p>\n<p>“Get household objects from your kitchen”, eh? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/eyes.png?v=12\" title=\":eyes:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":eyes:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Now there’s a mechanic <em>I’m</em> not above using!</p>\n<p>“What’s the dangly cheese of this universe?” is another excellently worded question.</p>\n<p>So Fanatic actualy killed Ta, goy iy, goy iy.</p>\n<p>Two variants minimum is something I’ve really adhered to in Sentinels design. It just makes heroes better.</p>\n<p>‘Letters Paige’ oh my god <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/woman_facepalming.png?v=12\" title=\":woman_facepalming:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":woman_facepalming:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Slaughterhouse Six comic is basically all Ray Manta, calling it now.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2026-07-21T21:58:20.069Z",
      "reply_count": 1,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 3,
      "reads": 18,
      "readers_count": 17,
      "score": 38.6,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 32460,
      "topic_slug": "editor-s-note-91",
      "display_username": "KateWalker",
      "primary_group_name": null,
      "flair_name": null,
      "flair_url": null,
      "flair_bg_color": null,
      "flair_color": null,
      "flair_group_id": null,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
