      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Wait, what's a Tango? o_o; Am I stupid or just old?\n\nNo, yeah, that last Bloodsworn Entertainment question is fantastic. XD\n\nLooking more into it, I think it's safe to say Grant Morrison's pronouns are they/he, and they're not terribly concerned either way.\n\nNo, Orbo is not scrunkly. XD He's two letters off blorbo though, so that might fit.\n\n\"We're not liars, which as you know is a lie\" is the best answer to anything I've ever heard lmao\n\nLearning Setback's secret identity is very Lex Luthor in Flash's body.\n\n\"Get household objects from your kitchen\", eh? :eyes: Now there's a mechanic *I'm* not above using!\n\n\"What's the dangly cheese of this universe?\" is another excellently worded question.\n\nSo Fanatic actualy killed Ta, goy iy, goy iy.\n\nTwo variants minimum is something I've really adhered to in Sentinels design. It just makes heroes better.\n\n'Letters Paige' oh my god 🤦‍♀️\n\nSlaughterhouse Six comic is basically all Ray Manta, calling it now.",
